  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Federation for Human Rights, FIDH, core support 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">International Federation for Human Rights, FIDH, k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to International Federation for Human Rights (FIDH), a global network of more than 190 human rights organisations from 117 countries. FIDH works for the promotion of human rights, women&apos;s rights, migrants&apos;rights and rule of law and for the protection of human rights defenders, mainly in DAC countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till FIDH, International Federation for Human Rights, f&#xf6;r perioden 2025- 2027.

FIDH &#xe4;r en federation best&#xe5;ende av 192 MR-organisationer fr&#xe5;n 117 l&#xe4;nder. FIDH verkar f&#xf6;r att skydda och uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;lla de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna s&#xe5;som de uttrycks i FN&apos;s deklaration om de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna och de centrala konventionerna f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. FIDH riktar sig b&#xe5;de mot ansvarsb&#xe4;rare och r&#xe4;ttighetsb&#xe4;rare.</narrative>
  </description>
